        </section>

        <section>
          <h3 id="support-terms" class={sectionTitle}>Support Terms</h3>
          <ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 text-sm">
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>Billed annually in advance.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Prices are in US dollars.</span></li>
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>No service credits.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">A missed target is not refunded automatically, though Semantius may compensate it at its discretion. Fees are not refundable.</span></li>
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>Named contacts only.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Requests are accepted from your named contacts.</span></li>
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>Liability is capped.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">It is limited to the fees you paid in the preceding 12 months.</span></li>
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>No IP indemnification on these plans.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Cover against claims that the software infringes someone else's intellectual property needs an Enterprise agreement.</span></li>
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>Two releases supported.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Support covers the current release and the one before it.</span></li>
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>Closure dates are published in advance.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Those days do not count as business hours.</span></li>
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-5"><strong>Renewal is optional.</strong> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Either party may decline to renew, without giving a reason.</span></li>
