        <a href="#cloud" data-pagefind-ignore class="group flex items-center justify-between gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-foreground/10 bg-foreground/2 p-8 hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors">
          <span>
            <span class="block text-lg font-bold mb-1">Would you rather not run it yourself?</span>
            <span class="block text-sm text-muted-foreground">The cloud runs Semantius for you, with a free plan to start on.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-primary whitespace-nowrap">See Cloud <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
